<title>USA: Mace Security names Marvin CEO, president.</title>
<headline>Mace Security names Marvin CEO, president.</headline>
<dateline>BENNINGTON, Vt. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mace Security International Inc said Monday it has named Marvin Brown, the former vice president of a New York investment group, as president and chief executive, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Brown, who was senior vice president and director of corporate finance at Wolff Investment Group, succeeds as president Robert Norman, who is stepping down, the company said.</p>
